  mailText: "<size=12>Good morning!\n\nWe hope you\u2019re growing comfortable in
    your new position.\n\nFrom today onward, we will sometimes require you to cross-check
    information on the report sheets with the <b>employee database</b>, accessed
    through the <b>EYE</b> icon on your desktop.\n\n<b>Reminder:<b> In case of confusion,
    you can find any information you need in the <b>Nurturing Booklet<b>, also present
    on your computer!"
